+The hat operator $\times$ maps a 3D vector $\mathbf{v} = [v_x, v_y, v_z]^T$ to a skew-symmetric matrix:
+$$
+\mathbf{v}^\times = \begin{bmatrix} 0 & -v_z & v_y \\ v_z & 0 & -v_x \\ -v_y & v_x & 0 \end{bmatrix}
